    rectangle "<size:13><color:#5d4037><plain>MEAN copies packed &#91;T, H&#93; as fp16 and reduces with MeanPool on the host.</plain></color></size>\n<size:13><color:#5d4037><plain>Destagger of a device fp32 sum (to(fp16) then convert) is garbage (torch-spyre&#35;2971). index&#95;add&#95; (&#35;3507) would let the reduce stay on the card.</plain></color></size>" as n026 #back:FFF8E1;line:F9A825;text:5d4037
