      rectangle "<size:14><color:#37474f>dynamic=False → sizes are baked in as constants.  </color></size>\n<size:14><color:#37474f>A graph built for 128 tokens works only for 128.  </color></size>\n<size:14><color:#37474f>A new count means a new compile.</color></size>" as n042 #back:transparent;line:transparent;text:37474f
