      rectangle "<size:14><color:#37474f>· The metadata always describes the real batch, so no  </color></size>\n<size:14><color:#37474f>padded row is ever pooled.</color></size>\n<size:14><color:#37474f>&#160;</color></size>\n<size:14><color:#37474f>· Padding the body is safe: each layer treats every  </color></size>\n<size:14><color:#37474f>token row on its own.</color></size>" as n051 #back:transparent;line:transparent;text:37474f
